From 0f4cf7ac5c207384f393c8722d42900e8eefef4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:40:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mix.json: the ground sound thread's land block of 05:40Z
 (tank machine guns by army; two more MG parts)

land.tankMg: a tank's machine guns play her army's row (GER MG 34 on
mg42_burst_01/02, USA M1919 and UK Besa on the M240G takes, SOV DT on
maxim_burst), and the Sherman's roof .50 on gunner_burst (the real M2).
land.mgClose.parts gains gunner_burst [0, 1.18] and maxim_burst [1.85, 2.71],
with a _parts note. No take from outside the approved pack; nothing in the
air block changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L4rhz35oCkUv94Xb2EwCjp
---
 .../Content/Data/Sound/mix.json               | 23 +++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 21 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

