pson_cock), each null with a note, so no clip cue asks for a missing take; no sound changes. 22 Nov 04:20Z: round nine stamped by Brian (03:40Z): real B-17s replace the studio library's. Riding a B-17 plays one of two recordings from inside one (air.closeView.bed.interior B-17, a list now, one per ridden bomber), and a B-17 formation's engines are three B-17s filmed flying over (air.loops B-17); levels unchanged (-20.0 LUFS). Land block updated 22 Nov 05:40Z by the ground sound thread: land.tankMg (a tank's machine guns by army, and the Sherman's roof .50 on gunner_burst), and land.mgClose.parts gains gunner_burst and maxim_burst (_parts says why); no take from outside the approved pack.",
